    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "How to Play\r\n\r\nUpon starting, you will see a map table with two ships:
    yours (left) and the enemy's (right). The pawns represent your crew. Click a
    pawn to select and move it.\r\n\r\nPlacing a pawn directly next to a ship module
    assigns that crew member to it.\r\nShip Modules\r\n\r\nThere are three color-coded
    modules on your ship:\r\n\r\n    Cannon (Red): Requires 2 crew members to fire.\r\n\r\n   
    Mast (Blue): Each assigned crew member increases your chance to evade enemy shots.\r\n\r\n   
    Helm (Green): Requires 1 crew member to allow your ship to move across the battlefield.\r\n\r\nMovement
    & Boarding\r\n\r\nShip positions are tracked by ship pawns at the top of the
    map. When the ships meet, boarding begins. During boarding, place your crew member
    next to an enemy and click on the enemy to attack.\r\nThe Shop\r\n\r\nA shop
    will appear after each fight, allowing you to spend gold on ship and crew upgrades."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f3dc7efee90d2c742b64a3997a827dfd, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 8429263278181023031, guid: f3dc7efee90d2c742b64a3997a827dfd, type: 2}
